    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strap in, press the gas, and keep your precious cargo intact! <strong>Egg Racing</strong> is a fast-paced driving game that dares you to speed through whimsical tracks\u2014without cracking the fragile egg perched in your car. Developed by <strong>Isomuna</strong>, whose name \u201cIso Muna\u201d (Finnish for \u201cbig egg\u201d) reflects both our humble beginnings and grand ambitions, Egg Racing combines the thrill of high-octane motorsport with the delicate touch of a balancing act.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Egg-cellent Challenge</strong> \u2013 Race against the clock while carefully protecting your egg. One wrong move, and it\u2019s game over!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cartoony Chaos</strong> \u2013 Dive into vibrant, cartoony graphics that match the fun, playful nature of each track.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Tracks</strong> \u2013 Master an array of challenging courses, each designed to test your reflexes, speed, and precision driving skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rewarding Gameplay</strong> \u2013 Every second counts in these swift, exhilarating races. Hone your technique to climb the leaderboards and earn your bragging rights.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Born from Finland\u2019s Natural Beauty</strong> \u2013 Our small team has been inspired by Finland\u2019s landscape, so expect a touch of nature\u2019s charm to shine through in every turn.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rev up your engine, hold on to your egg, and see if you can beat the odds\u2014or end up with egg on your face!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strap in, press the gas, and keep your precious cargo intact! <strong>Egg Racing</strong> is a fast-paced driving game that dares you to speed through whimsical tracks\u2014without cracking the fragile egg perched in your car. Developed by <strong>Isomuna</strong>, whose name \u201cIso Muna\u201d (Finnish for \u201cbig egg\u201d) reflects both our humble beginnings and grand ambitions, Egg Racing combines the thrill of high-octane motorsport with the delicate touch of a balancing act.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Egg-cellent Challenge</strong> \u2013 Race against the clock while carefully protecting your egg. One wrong move, and it\u2019s game over!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cartoony Chaos</strong> \u2013 Dive into vibrant, cartoony graphics that match the fun, playful nature of each track.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Tracks</strong> \u2013 Master an array of challenging courses, each designed to test your reflexes, speed, and precision driving skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rewarding Gameplay</strong> \u2013 Every second counts in these swift, exhilarating races. Hone your technique to climb the leaderboards and earn your bragging rights.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Born from Finland\u2019s Natural Beauty</strong> \u2013 Our small team has been inspired by Finland\u2019s landscape, so expect a touch of nature\u2019s charm to shine through in every turn.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rev up your engine, hold on to your egg, and see if you can beat the odds\u2014or end up with egg on your face!</p>",
    "short_description": "Race against time and keep your fragile egg safe in Egg Racing! Speed through cartoony tracks, master challenging turns, and prove your precision driving skills. One misstep and your egg goes splat\u2014can you handle the pressure without cracking?",
